      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.58 (up from ₹5.84 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.78b (up 64% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹130.1m (up 30% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 4.7% (down from 5.9% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 93% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 87% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
